3281 61.6517 64.2089 60.6073C65.0897 59.5628 64.957 58.0021 63.9126 57.1214L60.723 60.9036ZM52.2213 53.7341L60.723 60.9036L63.9126 57.1214L55.4109 49.9519L52.2213 53.7341Z\" fill=\"#2172D0\"></path> </svg> Application Instruction </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Product ID</span></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Input</span></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Rated</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voltage</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(V)</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Current</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(A)</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Operating</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voltage</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(V)</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Locked-Rotor</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Torque</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(G*CM)</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Stall Current</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(A)</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">No Load Speed</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(RPM)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Rotating</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Direction</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Output Shaft Type</span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">LA008</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">SH1.0-2P</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">6V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">0.05A～0.10A<br/>(100～200g*cm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">3V~7V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">250</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">≤0.16A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">25</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">CW</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Right angle output shaft</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>The N20 Reduction Gear Motor is a low-power reduction motor with a D-shaped output shaft, suitable for applications requiring continuous rotation of objects. The motor can be connected to the <a href=\"../../../products/power-distribution-board-pdb-4-channels\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Power Distribution Board (PDB) with 4 Channels</strong></span></a><strong> </strong>using the <a href=\"products/wire-pair-with-sh1-0?skr=yes&amp;_pos=1&amp;_sid=cfc3d87c1&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Wire Pair with SH1.0-2PIN-5CM/10CM/20CM. <strong> </strong></strong></span></a></p>\n</div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/power-distribution-board-pdb-4-channels\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">In the box</h2>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 95px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>N20 Single Shaft Worm Gear Motor </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<p>Wire Pair with SH1.0 </p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span>1</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Considerations</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Please use a power supply within the working voltage range.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Avoid immersing the motor in water or getting the motor wet.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Use screws of the appropriate length to secure the gearbox to prevent thread slippage or damage to the gearbox from screws touching the gears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When using glue/adhesive to fix the motor, to prevent damage, do not let the glue/adhesive seep into the gearbox, shaft, or motor interior.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Regularly add a small amount of lubricant/grease to the gearbox to improve its lifespan and reduce noise.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The N20 Reduction Gear Motor is a low-power reduction motor with a D-shaped output shaft, suitable for applications requiring continuous rotation of objects. The motor can be connected to the Power Distribution Board (PDB) with 4 Channels using the Wire Pair with SH1.0-2PIN-5CM/10CM/20CM.\n\nPlease use a power supply within the working voltage range.\n\nAvoid immersing the motor in water or getting the motor wet.\n\nUse screws of the appropriate length to secure the gearbox to prevent thread slippage or damage to the gearbox from screws touching the gears.\n\nWhen using glue/adhesive to fix the motor, to prevent damage, do not let the glue/adhesive seep into the gearbox, shaft, or motor interior.\n\nRegularly add a small amount of lubricant/grease to the gearbox to improve its lifespan and reduce noise.",
